Bind Npc 21510 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 11510 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 525 "[Descendant of Hero] I'm asking for permission to participate."
    Journal for karus "You must deliver the map of monster's den to [Captain] Fargo at Luferson Castle."
    Journal for elmorad "You must deliver the map of monster's den to [Captain] Falkwine at El Morad Castle."
    Collect 1 of 910214000

Requires player level >= 60 and quest 524 is completed

Rewards
    Give 125000 experience
    Give 30000 coins

On available
    Say "Finally found the monster! Now we only need to be consent to kill it!"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "You are here at last! What did [Eslant Wise Man]Pablo tell you?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "It will be a headache, but the monster [Gredel] has to go down! Do you know of its location?\n\nDeliver [Monster Base Map] to [Captain] Fargo."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "You are here at last! What did [Eslant Wise Man]Agata tell you?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "It will be a headache, but the monster [Gredel] has to go down! Do you know of its location?\n\nDeliver [Monster Base Map] to [Captain] Falkwine."

On in_progress
    Say "Can't you bring a map properly!?"

On claimable
    Show quest "So its this place! Well done <selfname>!"
